China’s lidar and EV industries have a remarkable symbiosis and coevolution.
The push for smart driving in China has created a massive market for Chinese lidar firms, helping them to scale, cut costs, and innovate. This then feeds back into China’s smart driving and autonomous vehicle industry, analogous to the synergy between China’s battery and EV industries.
